sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant R as Runner
    participant B as Context Builder
    participant M as MemoryStore
    participant L as LLM

    U->>R: Request
    R->>B: Build context
    B->>M: retrieve(MemoryQuery)
    M-->>B: filtered ranked records
    B-->>R: context pack
    R->>L: prompt + context pack
    L-->>R: response
    R->>M: promote_event(optional)
    R-->>U: answer
